<title>SWITZERLAND: Interroll sets share price at 235 Sfrs.</title>
<headline>Interroll sets share price at 235 Sfrs.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONINO, Switzerland 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conveyor belt firm Interroll Holding AG said it had set the price on its first share issue at 235 Swiss francs per registered share.</p>
<p>The company said the sale involved 461,160 registered shares in Interroll Group. In May it had said that it would create a total of 854,000 shares, and wanted to list 50 to 60 percent of its share capital with the listing.</p>
<p>Trading on the Swiss Stock Exchange will begin on Thursday. -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
